  <title>Resource categories</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Resources</gui><gui>Resource categories</gui></guiseq> keeps
  the tags given to resources, such as Call back or Quote. Each has a colour,
  used in the calendar and the main window's to-do list.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p>To add one, click <gui>New</gui>, type the <gui>Tag name</gui>,
    choose its colour and click <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>To change one, double click it, change it and click
    <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Check <gui>Finished</gui> on a tag no longer in use; the
    calendar stops offering it.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
